TLA+ Specification of the Constitutional Kernel (Chapter I, Section 6.1)

```tla
---- MODULE ConstitutionalKernel ----
EXTENDS Naturals, FiniteSets

CONSTANTS Nodes,          \* set of interrupt authority nodes
          HeartbeatTimeout

